igMapName:           kube-root-ca.crt\n    Optional:                false\n    DownwardAPI:             true\nQoS Class:                   Burstable\nNode-Selectors:              <none>\nTolerations:                 node.kubernetes.io/disk-pressure:NoSchedule op=Exists\n                             node.kubernetes.io/memory-pressure:NoSchedule op=Exists\n                             node.kubernetes.io/not-ready:NoExecute op=Exists\n                             node.kubernetes.io/pid-pressure:NoSchedule op=Exists\n                             node.kubernetes.io/unreachable:NoExecute op=Exists\n                             node.kubernetes.io/unschedulable:NoSchedule op=Exists\nEvents:\n  Type    Reason     Age    From               Message\n  ----    ------     ----   ----               -------\n  Normal  Scheduled  4m27s  default-scheduler  Successfully assigned astronomy-shop/otel-collector-agent-7fmss to node0.htliang2-agent.insai-pg0.apt.emulab.net\n  Normal  Pulled     4m23s  kubelet            spec.containers{opentelemetry-collector}: Container image "otel/opentelemetry-collector-contrib:0.142.0" already present on machine\n  Normal  Created    4m19s  kubelet            spec.containers{opentelemetry-collector}: Created container: opentelemetry-collector\n  Normal  Started    4m18s  kubelet            spec.containers{opentelemetry-collector}: Started container opentelemetry-collector\n', id='4ae913a1-f1b8-45e2-96ff-e244e12c38a4', tool_call_id='chatcmpl-tool-9476e282fac407b8'), HumanMessage(content='You are now in the thinking stage. Choose a tool from the available tools and justify your choice.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='25388dba-f07a-44d5-90c3-dae0453529f8')]]
